{
  "page": 29,
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "• The conference expects that many papers will be foundational research and not tied",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        75.2083740234375,
        503.9957275390625,
        84.11493682861328
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to particular applications, let alone deployments. However, if there is a direct path to",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        86.11737060546875,
        503.999267578125,
        95.02393341064453
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "any negative applications, the authors should point it out. For example, it is legitimate",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        97.0263671875,
        504.0027770996094,
        105.93292999267578
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to point out that an improvement in the quality of generative models could be used to",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        107.93536376953125,
        504.0028381347656,
        116.84192657470703
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "generate deepfakes for disinformation. On the other hand, it is not needed to point out",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        118.8443603515625,
        503.9967041015625,
        127.75092315673828
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "that a generic algorithm for optimizing neural networks could enable people to train",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        129.75335693359375,
        503.99981689453125,
        138.659912109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "models that generate Deepfakes faster.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        140.662353515625,
        317.03570556640625,
        149.56890869140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The authors should consider possible harms that could arise when the technology is",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        153.90533447265625,
        503.9957580566406,
        162.8118896484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "being used as intended and functioning correctly, harms that could arise when the",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        164.8143310546875,
        503.9999084472656,
        173.72088623046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "technology is being used as intended but gives incorrect results, and harms following",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        175.723388671875,
        503.9977111816406,
        184.62994384765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "from (intentional or unintentional) misuse of the technology.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        186.63238525390625,
        404.9953918457031,
        195.5389404296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• If there are negative societal impacts, the authors could also discuss possible mitigation",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        199.8753662109375,
        504.0047302246094,
        208.78192138671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "strategies (e.g., gated release of models, providing defenses in addition to attacks,",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        210.78436279296875,
        505.239501953125,
        219.69091796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "mechanisms for monitoring misuse, mechanisms to monitor how a system learns from",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        221.693359375,
        504.0045166015625,
        230.59991455078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "feedback over time, improving the efficiency and accessibility of ML).",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        232.60235595703125,
        444.8857116699219,
        241.5089111328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "11. Safeguards",
      "bbox": [
        126.43099975585938,
        248.0587921142578,
        191.46728515625,
        257.08489990234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Question: Does the paper describe safeguards that have been put in place for responsible",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        263.75433349609375,
        504.00238037109375,
        272.660888671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "release of data or models that have a high risk for misuse (e.g., pretrained language models,",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        274.6633605957031,
        505.2452697753906,
        283.5699157714844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "image generators, or scraped datasets)?",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        285.5723571777344,
        300.1692810058594,
        294.4789123535156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Answer: [NA]",
      "bbox": [
        143.5070037841797,
        301.14935302734375,
        201.02110290527344,
        310.055908203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Justification: The paper does not release data or models that have a high risk for misuse.",
      "bbox": [
        143.67601013183594,
        316.725341796875,
        494.7779846191406,
        325.63189697265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guidelines:",
      "bbox": [
        143.8660125732422,
        332.30133056640625,
        189.80357360839844,
        341.2078857421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The answer NA means that the paper poses no such risks.",
      "bbox": [
        155.32301330566406,
        347.8773193359375,
        392.50262451171875,
        356.78387451171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• Released models that have a high risk for misuse or dual-use should be released with",
      "bbox": [
        155.32301330566406,
        361.1203308105469,
        504.0037841796875,
        370.02691650390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "necessary safeguards to allow for controlled use of the model, for example by requiring",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        372.02935791015625,
        504.0047607421875,
        380.9359130859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "that users adhere to usage guidelines or restrictions to access the model or implementing",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        382.9383544921875,
        504.0046691894531,
        391.84490966796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "safety filters.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        393.84735107421875,
        215.25782775878906,
        402.75390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• Datasets that have been scraped from the Internet could pose safety risks. The authors",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        407.0903625488281,
        504.0025939941406,
        415.9969177246094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "should describe how they avoided releasing unsafe images.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        417.9993591308594,
        398.72900390625,
        426.9059143066406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• We recognize that providing effective safeguards is challenging, and many papers do",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        431.2413635253906,
        504.0046691894531,
        440.1479187011719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "not require this, but we encourage authors to take this into account and make a best",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        442.1503601074219,
        504.0,
        451.0569152832031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "faith effort.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        453.06036376953125,
        208.81201171875,
        461.9669189453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "12. Licenses for existing assets",
      "bbox": [
        126.43099975585938,
        468.51678466796875,
        256.7921142578125,
        477.54290771484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Question: Are the creators or original owners of assets (e.g., code, data, models), used in",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        484.2123718261719,
        504.0023193359375,
        493.1189270019531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the paper, properly credited and are the license and terms of use explicitly mentioned and",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        495.1213684082031,
        503.9947204589844,
        504.0279235839844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "properly respected?",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        506.0303955078125,
        222.15213012695312,
        514.9369506835938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Answer: [Yes]",
      "bbox": [
        143.5070037841797,
        521.6063232421875,
        201.47940063476562,
        530.5128784179688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Justification: We mentioned the package used in the paper on Appendix A.5.",
      "bbox": [
        143.67601013183594,
        537.182373046875,
        449.2289733886719,
        546.0889282226562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guidelines:",
      "bbox": [
        143.8660125732422,
        552.7593383789062,
        189.80357360839844,
        561.6658935546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The answer NA means that the paper does not use existing assets.",
      "bbox": [
        155.32301330566406,
        568.3353271484375,
        424.73162841796875,
        577.2418823242188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The authors should cite the original paper that produced the code package or dataset.",
      "bbox": [
        155.32301330566406,
        581.577392578125,
        501.0251770019531,
        590.4839477539062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The authors should state which version of the asset is used and, if possible, include a",
      "bbox": [
        155.32301330566406,
        594.8203735351562,
        504.0025634765625,
        603.7269287109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "URL.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        605.7293701171875,
        186.2068328857422,
        614.6359252929688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The name of the license (e.g., CC-BY 4.0) should be included for each asset.",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        618.9723510742188,
        469.4936218261719,
        627.87890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• For scraped data from a particular source (e.g., website), the copyright and terms of",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        632.21435546875,
        503.9999694824219,
        641.1209106445312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "service of that source should be provided.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        643.1233520507812,
        329.92730712890625,
        652.0299072265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• If assets are released, the license, copyright information, and terms of use in the",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        656.3663330078125,
        503.9997253417969,
        665.2728881835938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "package should be provided. For popular datasets, paperswithcode.com/datasets",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        667.275390625,
        504.02423095703125,
        676.24169921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "has curated licenses for some datasets. Their licensing guide can help determine the",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        678.1843872070312,
        503.99981689453125,
        687.0909423828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "license of a dataset.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        689.0933837890625,
        241.80816650390625,
        697.9999389648438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• For existing datasets that are re-packaged, both the original license and the license of",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        702.3363647460938,
        504.0006103515625,
        711.242919921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the derived asset (if it has changed) should be provided.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        713.245361328125,
        385.69793701171875,
        722.1519165039062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "29",
      "bbox": [
        301.01898193359375,
        743.1333618164062,
        310.9815673828125,
        752.0399169921875
      ],
